# Extremes: C0 and G9 on every wave, velocity 1, pitch bends on a sweeping high note, both knob ends.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.3
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 2 127
note 2 G9 2 127
param p1 0 4
param p2 0 4
note 4 C0 2 127
note 6 G9 2 1
param p1 128 8
param p2 252 8
note 8 C8 4 127
bend 9 200
bend 10 -200
param p1 224 12
param p2 216 12
note 12 C8 2 127
note 14 C0 2 127
expect peak_below -11.9
